# Scratch + verification working files.
# 65 untracked files here were flooding the VS Code Source Control panel,
# which made a clean repo look like it had pending work everywhere.
# tmp/pdfs/financial-report-preview/index.html is already tracked and stays
# tracked -- ignore rules never apply to files git is already following.
tmp/

